{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey pilot! Ready to de-stress? Buckle up... or actually, maybe don't bother!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine this: You're at the controls of a cute little plane, with no finish line ahead, no countdown timer, and no annoying enemy planes on your tail. <strong>Just you and the vast sky, having an eternal, relaxing &quot;date&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls? <strong>Just one finger is enough!</strong> Tap lightly to steer your little darling through graceful turns, climbs, and dives. No complex button combos, no hardcore flight sim, <strong>only pure, intuitive flying fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated endless journey. <strong>Here, there's no failure, no Game Over, only free flight as you please.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of <strong>100 achievements</strong>. Earn a medal for every kilometer traveled! Only the truly persistent pilots will earn the <strong>gold-trimmed badge engraved</strong> with &quot;100KM!&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/59ac9a65d90bc0591903dfe05db20822.avif?t=1755272132\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget the destination, embrace the journey itself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Warning: First-time flight crash rate is a whopping 97%! (Unofficial data, but bragging rights guaranteed if you survive!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f Keyboard Controls:</strong><br>\u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192\u00a0<strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong> - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space\u00a0- Boost <br><strong> </strong><br>ESC - Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Controller Controls:</strong><br><strong>Left Stick</strong> - Movement<br>B - Boost<strong> </strong> <br>Y<strong>\u00a0</strong>- Pause</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597500?t=1755272132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597500?t=1755272132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/e618f1918295e4baa4fac7f7c5ece356b9537053/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755272132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/e618f1918295e4baa4fac7f7c5ece356b9537053/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755272132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2713170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey pilot! Ready to de-stress? Buckle up... or actually, maybe don't bother!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine this: You're at the controls of a cute little plane, with no finish line ahead, no countdown timer, and no annoying enemy planes on your tail. <strong>Just you and the vast sky, having an eternal, relaxing &quot;date&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls? <strong>Just one finger is enough!</strong> Tap lightly to steer your little darling through graceful turns, climbs, and dives. No complex button combos, no hardcore flight sim, <strong>only pure, intuitive flying fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated endless journey. <strong>Here, there's no failure, no Game Over, only free flight as you please.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of <strong>100 achievements</strong>. Earn a medal for every kilometer traveled! Only the truly persistent pilots will earn the <strong>gold-trimmed badge engraved</strong> with &quot;100KM!&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/59ac9a65d90bc0591903dfe05db20822.avif?t=1755272132\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget the destination, embrace the journey itself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Warning: First-time flight crash rate is a whopping 97%! (Unofficial data, but bragging rights guaranteed if you survive!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f Keyboard Controls:</strong><br>\u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192\u00a0<strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong> - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space\u00a0- Boost <br><strong> </strong><br>ESC - Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Controller Controls:</strong><br><strong>Left Stick</strong> - Movement<br>B - Boost<strong> </strong> <br>Y<strong>\u00a0</strong>- Pause</p>","developers":["ZhiFeng Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/e495b57